Error [E0118]: The name `outer` is already taken here
  --> tests/ui/loop_label_namespace_collision.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     outer :: loop {
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Inside one function, each name refers to exactly one thing
 Fix: Pick a different name, or assign to the existing one with `outer = ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
